## Dastoor-e-Shab

Yeh shehr-e-khamoshan hai ya aalam ki bheed hai,
Har shakhs apne aap mein ek daastan liye.
Raahon mein chiragh hain magar rasta dhuwaan sa hai,
Hum chal rahe hain dhoondte apna nishaan liye.

## Faslay Aur Qurbat

Jab bolne se baat bigadne lage kahin,
Behtar hai aadmi zara khamosh ho rahe.
Tanhaiyon ke dasht mein jab shaam dhal paday,
Apne hi aansuon se koi aankh dho rahe.

Koshish yahi rahi ke kisi ko gila na ho,
Lekin naseeb mein tha fasana alag sa hi.
Duniya ki bheed mein jo kabhi dhoondte thay hum,
Woh shakhs aaine mein mila, mukhtalif sa hi.
